WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:04,780
Be careful, if anything goes wrong, run back immediately, don’t hesitate

2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:10,534
all alive

3
00:00:10,534 --> 00:00:14,370
alive

4
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:17,570
Stop hugging me and let's go. We have to get ahead of those crazy people.

5
00:00:17,570 --> 00:00:19,260
