7
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:28,270
Ji Feifan and I discussed and planned to go to the gas station more than 20 kilometers away.

8
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:29,790
That's the nearest supply point

9
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:33,870
We guess that after you get rid of the pursuers, you will most likely go that way.

10
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:36,190
Fortunately, I have waited for your news

11
00:00:36,190 --> 00:00:38,030
Are you two okay?

12
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:40,830
It's okay, I fell down, don't delay leaving
